WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.320
A good defense plans for the throw that gets away.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.960
On a throw to first, right field moves behind the receiver.

3
00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:14.251
If the ball gets past first, the backup stops it.

4
00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:20.161
On other throws, teammates back up third base or home plate.

5
00:00:20.641 --> 00:00:24.921
The best spot is behind the throw, with room to react.

6
00:00:25.641 --> 00:00:28.597
Your league sets the runner rules.

7
00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:31.671
Your job is preventing extra bases.
